SUMMARY:Easy bike ride instead of the long run — zero impact\, aerobic re
 covery. Keep it chill\; save the legs for Tuesday's power test. (90 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 of 17 - Build\nEASY RE-ENTRY — recovering from the fes
 tival weekend. No max efforts\, no heavy legs\, no CP test (moved to Wee
 k 6\, now a power test on fresh legs). Optional easy 4 km Thu or rest — 
