DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260811
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260812
SUMMARY:CP 3+12 power test — warm up\, 12 min all-out even pace\, 20-30 m
 in easy\, then 3 min all-out. Sets real power zones on fresh legs. Power
  is our trusted channel now.
