SUMMARY:Long day 2h15 time-on-feet (run/walk\, walk the climbs) (17 km)
DESCRIPTION:Week 6 of 17 - Build\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Tal
 k test.\nFirst real fitness read of the block — the CP power test\, Tues
