DTSTAMP:20260818T134501Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260913
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260914
SUMMARY:OPTIONAL easy ride 60-75 min - the day after the long day. Zero i
 mpact. THIS IS THE FIRST THING TO CUT when work bites.
DESCRIPTION:Week 11 of 17 - Build\nTERRAIN WEEKEND #1 of 2 - Posbank/Velu
 wezoom\, ~1h15 by car\, ~EUR 30 of petrol. Hard-surface descents\, 90-11
 0 m climbs. Twenty reps is 1\,800 m of real ascent AND descent. One day 
 there beats ten stairwell sessions\, because sand is compliant and actua
 lly REDUCES muscle damage relative to firm ground. Madeira is rock and s
 tone steps.\n49 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
