DTSTAMP:20260818T134501Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260920
SUMMARY:LONG DAY 2:35\, 900 m vert - Posbank if possible\, descents on ha
 rd surface DESCENT CUE: shorten the step\, 185-195 spm. Understriding cu
 t strength loss to -8.8% vs -15.5% at preferred step length - roughly ha
 lved. Do NOT coach foot strike: the more anterior the strike\, the LARGE
 R the quad torque loss. Let the terrain dictate it. (17 km)
DESCRIPTION:Week 11 of 17 - Build\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Ta
 lk test.\nTERRAIN WEEKEND #1 of 2 - Posbank/Veluwezoom\, ~1h15 by car\, 
 ~EUR 30 of petrol. Hard-surface descents\, 90-110 m climbs. Twenty reps 
 is 1\,800 m of real ascent AND descent. One day there beats ten stairwel
 l sessions\, because sand is compliant and actually REDUCES muscle damag
 e relative to firm ground. Madeira is rock and stone steps.\n43 days to 
 Ultra X Madeira 25K.
